{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When did you last take money out\nof your savings account yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5440,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not the interest going in.\nNot a statement arriving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9140,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something you did. Because\nyour state has a rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12780,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If nobody touches an account for three\nto five years, your bank must close"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17540,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it and pass the money to your state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20400,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the account most at risk is\nnot the one you use every week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24240,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the account you set aside on\npurpose and made a point of leaving alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28820,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is the thing good,\ncareful people never see coming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34880,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The interest the bank adds each\nmonth does not count as touching it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38900,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The statement it mails you does not count."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41640,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even a fee it takes out does not count."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44600,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of it came from you. To this rule,\nan account only the bank touches is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49420,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an account nobody is watching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52100,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will give you four things that decide\nwhether this reaches your money, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57220,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then two ways to stop it. The\nsecond way takes about a minute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62520,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if your money has already gone,\nit is not lost, and asking for it back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67960,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69720,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number one is what actually\ncounts as using your account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73780,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only something you do. A deposit you make."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77180,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A withdrawal you take. Signing in to\nlook at the balance on a computer or a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81680,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "telephone. A letter you write\nasking about the account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84920,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Any one of those tells your bank that\nthe person who owns this money is still"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89640,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here and still paying attention."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92060,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now hear what does not count, because\nthis is where good people lose money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96520,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they were being careful with. The\ninterest the bank adds each month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101100,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The statement that arrives in your post."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103380,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A monthly fee the bank takes out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105840,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A notice about new terms and conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108860,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of that is you. All of it is the\nbank moving numbers around inside its"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113200,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "own building, and every state in\nthe country treats it the same way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117540,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It proves nothing about whether\nthe owner is still there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120420,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want you to sit with\nhow strange that is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123660,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your balance can change every\nsingle month for five years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127620,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Money can go in. Money\ncan come out for fees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131500,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The paperwork can arrive at\nyour house on time, every time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134780,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at the end of those five years your\naccount can still be counted as one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139280,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that nobody has touched, because not a\nsingle one of those movements came from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143660,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your own hand. There is a reason the\nrule was built that way, and it is not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148180,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a foolish reason. If a bank could keep\nan account alive simply by adding a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152700,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "penny of interest to it, then no account\nwould ever be reported, and money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156840,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that truly had been abandoned would sit\nin banks forever with nobody looking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160800,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the owner. So the people who wrote\nthis decided that only the owner can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164640,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prove the owner is there.\nThat is fair enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167680,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The trouble is that nobody\nexplains it to the owner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171240,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number two is how many years it\ntakes before your bank must act."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176420,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Three to five, depending\non where you live."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179780,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your state decides it. Not your bank,\nnot the manager at the branch, and not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185120,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the person who opened the\naccount for you twenty years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188300,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That matters more than it\nmay sound, and this is why."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192920,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you telephone your branch and ask\nthem to make an exception for you, they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197580,
    "dDurationMs": 360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cannot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198880,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you explain that you are saving that\nmoney on purpose and you would rather"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203060,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it sat still, it changes nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206420,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bank is not choosing to do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208880,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bank is being told to do this, and\nif it fails to do it, the bank itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214100,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the one in trouble. So nobody at that\ncounter can protect you, however much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219400,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they might want to. And"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221820,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "notice which accounts this catches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224320,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not the everyday account with your\nSocial Security going in and your bills"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228200,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going out. That one\ngets touched constantly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232000,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It catches the savings account\nyou opened for an emergency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235780,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The account holding\nmoney for a grandchild."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238520,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The small account at the second bank\nyou stopped using when you moved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241940,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The certificate of deposit that renews\nitself every year without anybody looking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246780,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at it. In other words, it catches the\nmoney you were being most careful with,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252080,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the exact reason that you\nwere being careful with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255820,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the cruelty of it, and\nI do not use that word lightly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260400,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The person who spends everything\nis never caught by this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264300,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The person who saved, and set money\naside, and had the discipline to leave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268980,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it alone for a rainy day, is the only\nkind of person this can happen to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274580,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Doing the right thing is\nwhat puts you in front of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277580,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number three is where your\nbank sends the warning letter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280900,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before any of this can happen, the bank\nis required to write to you and give"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285020,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you the chance to say you are still there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287260,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That sounds like a real protection,\nand it would be, except for one thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291780,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That letter goes to the last\naddress the bank has for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295540,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about the last\nten years of your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297480,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you sold the house and downsized."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300420,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you moved closer to your children."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302620,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you went to live with family for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304480,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a while, or into care,\nor spent long stretches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307780,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a son or a daughter. If you told\nthe main bank about the new address but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312480,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never thought about the small account\nat the other bank, because why would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316020,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you. In every one of those cases, the\none letter that could have saved your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320820,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money is sitting in a hallway\nyou no longer walk through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324020,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the person now living at that\naddress has no idea what it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329260,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It looks like ordinary bank post."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331800,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It gets thrown away, or it gets sent\nback, and the bank writes down that it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336600,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tried. The requirement has been met."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339640,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The clock keeps running. Nobody has broken\nany rule, and your money still leaves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346020,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to be fair to the banks on this\none point, because it is not laziness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350560,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are told to write to the address\non file, and that is what they do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356520,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you and I both know that an address\non file at a bank you have not visited"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360760,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in nine years is no longer an address."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364460,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is old history sitting in a computer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367120,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that old history is standing between\nyou and every dollar in that account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372580,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number four is what happens to your\nmoney and to your safe deposit box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377340,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to be exact here, because most\npeople picture the wrong thing entirely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383680,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They picture the account being frozen,\nsitting there locked but waiting for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388200,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them, the way a bank freezes\nan account after somebody dies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392600,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is not what this is.\nThe account is closed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396380,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It stops existing. The money is sent\nto your state, and your state holds it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401700,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "under your name. The box is worse,\nand almost nobody knows this part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408000,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A safe deposit box that goes untouched\nruns on the same kind of clock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412940,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When it runs out, the box is\nforced open in front of witnesses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417120,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is inside is written\ndown, and then it is sold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421680,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rings that belonged to your mother."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423780,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The watch that belonged to your father."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426120,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The coins somebody in your family put\naway one at a time over forty years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430720,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of it sold at auction, and only the\nmoney from that sale is kept for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436180,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Read that again, slowly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438620,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do not get the ring back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440880,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is no drawer somewhere holding\nwhat belonged to your family until you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444860,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "come and ask for it. There is a sum of\nmoney, and the ring is now on the hand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449560,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a stranger. That is the part I would\nmost want a member of my own family"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453720,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to hear, because a box is exactly the\nkind of thing a careful person leaves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458280,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "alone for years on purpose. The whole\npoint of a box is that you do not open"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464100,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it. That is what it is for. And a box\nis where the things live that cannot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468680,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be replaced. Money can be replaced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471900,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A wedding ring worn by a woman\nwho is no longer here cannot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476080,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rule cannot tell the difference\nbetween the two, and it was never built"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480100,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to. Now let me hand you the two ways to\nstop it, and I should say plainly that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485400,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what follows is general guidance and not\nlegal or financial advice, so do check"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490800,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the number of years in your own state,\nbecause it is not the same everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495200,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number five is the one action that\nmakes the counting start over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498960,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take out one dollar. Put in one dollar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501620,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do it yourself, at the counter or on\na computer, on each account you hold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506880,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the whole protection. One\nmovement made by you, and your bank writes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511520,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down a new date, and the years\nbegin again from that day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515380,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is what I would do this\nweek, and it is a short list."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520960,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Write down every account\nwith your name on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523880,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not just the one you use.\nThe old savings account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527580,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The account at the bank you stopped using."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530140,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The certificate that renews on its own\nevery year and that you have not looked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534160,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at since. The box, if you have one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537420,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then touch each of them once. A dollar\nin or a dollar out, done by you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542560,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then put a note in your calendar to\ndo exactly the same thing next year on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547800,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same day. And while you have that\nlist in front of you, do the other half"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552480,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the job, because it\nis the half people skip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556500,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Telephone each bank and make sure the\naddress they hold for you is the one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560800,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you actually live at now. That is the\nsingle most valuable telephone call in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566120,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this whole video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567940,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One version of that letter\nreaches you in time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other version reaches\nsomebody you have never met."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574840,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If getting to a branch is hard,\nthis can all be done from a chair."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579800,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most banks will let you move a dollar\nbetween two of your own accounts over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583560,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the telephone, and that counts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586460,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Signing in on a computer or a telephone\nto look at the balance counts in most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590820,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "states as well. And if you would rather\nhave it on paper, write a short letter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595040,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the bank asking for a statement\non that account and keep a copy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599620,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A written request from the owner is\none of the clearest signals there is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604420,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number six is how to get your money\nback after your state has taken it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609100,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because a good many of you are going to\ngo and look, and some of you are going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612940,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to find that this already happened,\nperhaps years ago, to an account you had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617860,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "genuinely forgotten about. This\nnext part should ease your mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623480,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is still yours. Your state does\nnot spend it and does not keep it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629300,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It holds it under your name, and\nno deadline ever runs out on you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634140,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Money handed over thirty years ago is\nstill claimable today by the person who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639340,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "owned it, and if that person has\ndied, by the family who inherited it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644480,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You will have to show who you are, and\nif you are claiming for a parent you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648980,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will have to show that as well, but\nthe money is sitting there waiting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653680,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one warning matters here, because\nthese people find the newly bereaved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659440,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the newly retired first. If somebody\ncontacts you offering to recover money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665080,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in your name in exchange for a share of\nit, understand what they are actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670280,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "selling. They are selling you a search\nthat you are able to do on your own,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674800,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at no cost, in about ten minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678060,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every state runs its own office\nfor exactly this purpose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682680,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Never hand a stranger a percentage of\nyour own money for giving it back to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686700,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you. So let me set the six\ndown one final time, plainly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692320,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What counts as using your account, which\nis only ever something you do yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697640,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many years it takes, which is three\nto five and decided by your state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702780,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where the warning letter goes, which\nis the last address the bank was given."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707460,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What actually happens, which is the\naccount closed and the box sold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711900,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The one action that starts the counting\nover, which is a single dollar moved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716300,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by your own hand. And how to get back\nmoney that has already gone, which costs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721080,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you nothing at all. Nobody is\ngoing to telephone you about this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725460,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your bank has no reason to, and your\nstate has no way of finding you if the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730260,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "address it was handed is wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731900,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The whole thing runs on paperwork, in\nsilence, and it was never designed to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737300,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be cruel. It was designed for money that\ntruly had been abandoned by somebody"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742240,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who was never coming back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744840,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It simply cannot tell the difference\nbetween an account that was abandoned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748640,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and an account that was being guarded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751000,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are now able to tell the difference,\nand that was the whole point of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755300,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "last twelve minutes. If somebody in\nyour family has an old account or a box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760500,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have not touched in years, send\nthis to them tonight and ask them one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764860,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "question. When did you last move\na dollar in that account yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769320,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If they cannot answer it, they\nhave their job for the week."
    } ]
  } ]
}
